  "instructions": {
    "en": "Choose one current romantic relationship or your most recent significant one. Recall ordinary disagreements during the past four weeks, or its final four weeks if it ended; this window is editorial. Keep the same relationship in mind. Rate how often each described action occurred on relevant occasions, from 1 to 5. If there was no relevant opportunity, you cannot judge or prefer not to answer, choose unscored. All twenty recognised choices, including unscored, can finish. Each five-item group needs five numeric answers for its separate mean. No total, best group or fight type is assigned. You do not need to contact anyone, re-enter an unsafe discussion, apologise or forgive.",
    "zh": "选择一段当前恋爱关系，或最近一段重要关系，始终以同一段为参照。回想过去四周的普通分歧；已结束时回想最后四周，四周是编辑窗口。按1—5评价所述行为在相关机会中出现的频率；无机会、无法判断或不愿答时不计分。二十项包括不计分的有效选择均可完成；每组五项数值齐才给独立均分，不合总分、不选最好组或派吵架类型。无需联系任何人、重入不安全讨论、道歉或原谅。"
